14. Prescription Data

     The workflow can associate the uploaded prescription with relevant customer information.

      Example:

      Prescription
      │
      ├── Customer
      ├── Uploaded File
      ├── File Type
      ├── Upload Date
      ├── Status
      └── Review Information

      This provides a structured foundation for pharmacy-side prescription management.

15. Security Considerations

      Prescription documents can contain sensitive medical information, so the upload workflow was designed with controlled access in mind.

      Important considerations include:

      Restricting prescription access to authorized users.
      Validating uploaded files.
      Preventing unsupported file uploads.
      Associating files with the appropriate customer.
      Avoiding unnecessary public exposure of prescription documents.
      Maintaining controlled pharmacy-side access.

16. Error Handling

